Subject: [PATCH 21/30] Bench: replay a 3-finger column scroll on a Darwin
 notification

notifyutil -p com.barut.OmniWM.bench.columnScroll feeds the same 120 Hz gesture (slow, fast,
reversal, flick) through the real gesture pipeline, so scroll changes can be measured
before/after with a trace capture instead of hand gestures.
